        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 17368, Narrow Plate Latchset with Chic Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHowever simple the Chic Narrow Plate Leverset may seem, it is more than just a door lever. The 8-1/4\" by 1-5/16\" narrow plate makes it stunning. Plus it is more substantial than a regular lever and rose combination while maintaining a sleekness that has a grip on current fashions. Polished, the clean lines of this latchset means that it is not something that will be dated any time soon; after all, elegance like this is timeless. Good for residential and commercial uses, it meets ADA requirements. The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. For interior doors with 1-3/8\" thicknesses and either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C13PC2_size.gif?v=1704354562\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Narrow Interior Door Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Chic Narrow Plate Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ADA accessibility requirements.</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>All critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout.</li>\r\n<li>For commercial and residential use.</li>\r\n<li>For interior use only.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy function features a privacy mortise bolt constructed of a metal case and featuring a solid brass bolt underneath the lever and latch. It has an emergency release on outside plate.</li>\r\n<li>The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. <b>Does Not</b> fit standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Interior Chic Narrow Plate Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-5/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Privacy Function Turnpiece: 1-5/8\" x 1-1/8 proj.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy</b>: For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 1 lever, 1 backplate, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 backplates, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates by lever from either side of door. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, tubular latch, spindle and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Upper latch operates by lever from either side of door. Locks by privacy bolt with turnpiece on inside an emergency release on outside plate. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, spindle, mounting hardware, privacy turnpiece, lever operated tubular latch, and thumbturn operated privacy mortise bolt and case.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/locking-door-bolt-size.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"255\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Chic Narrow Plate Leverset",
                "description": "However simple the Chic Narrow Plate Leverset may seem, it is more than just a door lever. The 8-1/4 inch by 1-5/16 inch narrow plate makes it stunning. Plus it is more substantial than a regular lever and rose combination while maintaining a sleekness that has a grip on current fashions. Polished, the clean lines of this latchset means that it is not something that will be dated any time soon; after all, elegance like this is timeless. Good for residential and commercial uses, it meets ADA requirements. The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. For interior doors with 1-3/8 inch thicknesses and either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
